================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

Michka bundles or depends on the following open-source libraries. Components
marked [Windows] ship only in the Windows client (michka_c.exe); components
marked [frontend] are JavaScript assets embedded in the dashboard.

  Package / Library                                  License        Copyright
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────  ─────────────  ─────────────────────────────────────────
  .NET 10 Runtime & ASP.NET Core                     MIT            .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.0.x                       MIT            .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Microsoft.Extensions.FileProviders.Embedded 10.0.x MIT            .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.WindowsServices 10.0.x  [Windows]    .NET Foundation and Contributors        (MIT)
  System.Management 10.0.x  [Windows]                MIT            .NET Foundation and Contributors
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────  ─────────────  ─────────────────────────────────────────
  SQLitePCLRaw 2.x (bundle_e_sqlite3, transitive)    Apache-2.0     Eric Sink / SQLitePCLRaw contributors
  Apache ECharts 5.x  [frontend]                     Apache-2.0     The Apache Software Foundation
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────  ─────────────  ─────────────────────────────────────────
  SQLite database engine (native e_sqlite3)          Public Domain  D. Richard Hipp / SQLite authors
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────  ─────────────  ─────────────────────────────────────────

The Windows client additionally calls native Windows OS components (gdi32 /
D3DKMT for GPU telemetry, pdh.dll performance counters, WMI, and sc.exe for
service control). These are part of Microsoft Windows and are not bundled or
redistributed by Michka.

